<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Supplements the Dewesoft ESI of the KRYPTONi 4xLV and 8xLV (KRYPTON LV.xml).
     Written from the Dewesoft third-party EtherCAT masters manual, V26-3, section
     9.1.8, without a card. Data types that the manual does not give follow those of the
     IOLITE 6xSTG. Not tested on hardware. Value 1 of 0x8020:07, in which only DewesoftX
     reads the data, is left out, as no card was tested in it. -->
